OL,3,ATanzanian opposition leader found
OL,4,Aguilty of incitement
OL,5,
OL,6,FTanzania's main opposition leader,
OL,7,FTundu Lissu, has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fincitement in a case that has raised
OL,9,Fconcerns about political freedoms in
OL,10,Fthe East African country.
OL,12,FThe 58-year-old, who has been detained
OL,13,Fsince April last year, was convicted
OL,14,Fover remarks he made while campaigning
OL,15,Ffor electoral reforms ahead of the
OL,16,Fdisputed 2025 general election.
OL,18,FA panel of three judges at the High
OL,19,FCourt in Dar es Salaam acquitted him of
OL,20,Fthe more serious charge of treason.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
